","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T11:23:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T11:23:44Z","body":"> Could you share what areas in the rendering code you thought would be good candidates?\r\n\r\nI basically searched the codebase for `memnew_arr` (90 results) and looked at the structs.\r\n\r\nMost of them had no default values, so they should be trivial already (like `VoxelGILight`). Could make a `static_assert` for that if we care.\r\n\r\nSome were initialized to `nullptr` or `0` which would disqualify trivial construction.\r\nIt's really unfortunate we can't iterate the type fields to automatically mark any types like these as trivially constructible!\r\nAnyway, going through it quickly again, I can identify `GodotConvexPolygonShape2D`, `GodotSoftBody3D::Link`, `GodotSoftBody3D::LinkDeps`, `GlobalShaderUniforms::ValueUsage`, `Mesh::Surface::LOD`, `Mesh::Surface::BlendShape`, `RasterizerSceneGLES3::InstanceSort` (technically has an uninited float but `memset` is probably still faster).\r\nThere might be more that I missed.\r\n\r\nAnother interesting contender is `List::Element`, which could be marked zero initializable if `T` is too. Could do that in a follow up PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2724383534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2855955209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104064#issuecomment-2855955209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104064","id":2855955209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qOmsJ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T20:55:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T20:55:30Z","body":"This looks great to me, but I think we should start using it in a few places before merging so we can confirm that it is working and (hopefully) see the performance benefits more clearly. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2855955209/r